  "ruleText": "Rev 1803.01 Developed Land. Developed land, as defined by RSA 79-B:2, V, shall be taxable in accordance with RSA 75:1.\n\nSource. #5231, eff 9-27-91; ss by #5353, eff 3-12-92; ss by #6692, eff 2-21-98; ss by #8567, eff 2-14-06; ss by #10560, eff 3-28-14; ss by #13867, eff 2-8-24",
